<title>USA: Santa Monica Bank raises qtly payout.</title>
<headline>Santa Monica Bank raises qtly payout.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA MONICA, Calif. 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Santa Monica Bank Wednesday said the board of directors declared a 60 percent increase in the quarterly dividend to $0.08 a share from $0.05 payable February 28, to stockholders of record as of February 14.</p>
</text>
